<title>UK: Oppenheimer sets up European investment banking.</title>
<headline>Oppenheimer sets up European investment banking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oppenheimer International, the European subsidiary of Oppenheimer Group Inc, said on Monday it was expanding its European operations to include investment banking.</p>
<p>It will initially concentrate on serving the equity financing and advising companies in the information technology and healthcare sectors.</p>
<p>U.S.-based Oppenheimer Inc is a privately owned securities brokerage and investment firm founded in 1950.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
